# Send a request with the "Send Request" link above it (REST Client extension).
# The reference API runs in this container on port 3001.

### Is the API running?
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### All tasks
GET http://localhost:3001/api/tasks

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Buy milk", "priority": 1 }
